{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e07-scene-18",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "拉开与超新星的距离  (Pulling Ahead of Supernova)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Watching Wen Simo's commentary from the chief editor's office, Xingzi insists Twelve Singers must overhaul its competition rules to stay ahead of ME's Supernova, while Kaiwen teases her favourite host. Listen to their Mandarin banter first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "下一季比赛规则必须得改，否则跟超新星拉不开距离。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "谁不知道要改啊，问题是往哪个方向改？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "要是去掉所有媒体评审，那后台宣传运营怎么配合啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "拼媒体资源咱们拼不过对手，他们刚完成传媒并购。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大就算再能打，在这方面顶多也只能打个平手。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "再说了，不就是你们家老闻头在电视上随口说了几句吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你看他头发上的发油越抹越多，简直太夸张了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你才是老头呢！我们家闻思默哪儿老了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "都四十好几的人了，你可真行啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你一个大男人，整天不干正事还说一堆废话。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "拉开跟超新星之间的距离，本来就是老大一直在想的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "是老大的想法没错，但是他现在住院了，先别拿工作烦他。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "下一季比赛规则必须得改，否则跟超新星拉不开距离。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Next season's competition rules must change, or we will not pull ahead of Supernova.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "谁不知道要改啊，问题是往哪个方向改？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who does not know we need changes? The real question is in which direction.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "要是去掉所有媒体评审，那后台宣传运营怎么配合啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If we scrap the entire media jury, how will our publicity operations tie in?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "拼媒体资源咱们拼不过对手，他们刚完成传媒并购。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In media resources we cannot outmatch our rival; they just completed a media merger.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大就算再能打，在这方面顶多也只能打个平手。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No matter how capable our boss is, at best we would only fight to a draw there.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "再说了，不就是你们家老闻头在电视上随口说了几句吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Besides, was that not just your dear old Wen Simo making casual remarks on TV?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你看他头发上的发油越抹越多，简直太夸张了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look at how much hair oil he slicks on — more and more every episode.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你才是老头呢！我们家闻思默哪儿老了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are the old man! How is Wen Simo old in the slightest?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "都四十好几的人了，你可真行啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He is well past forty already — listen to you!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你一个大男人，整天不干正事还说一堆废话。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A grown man like you gossiping all day and spouting nonsense.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "拉开跟超新星之间的距离，本来就是老大一直在想的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Widening the lead over Supernova has been on our boss's mind all along.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "是老大的想法没错，但是他现在住院了，先别拿工作烦他。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'True, it is his idea, yet he is in hospital right now — let us not trouble him with work.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "下一季比赛规则必须得改，否则跟超新星拉不开距离。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "谁不知道要改啊，问题是往哪个方向改？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "要是去掉所有媒体评审，那后台宣传运营怎么配合啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "拼媒体资源咱们拼不过对手，他们刚完成传媒并购。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大就算再能打，在这方面顶多也只能打个平手。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "再说了，不就是你们家老闻头在电视上随口说了几句吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你看他头发上的发油越抹越多，简直太夸张了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你才是老头呢！我们家闻思默哪儿老了？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "都四十好几的人了，你可真行啊！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你一个大男人，整天不干正事还说一堆废话。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "拉开跟超新星之间的距离，本来就是老大一直在想的事。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "是老大的想法没错，但是他现在住院了，先别拿工作烦他。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Beneath their playful bickering over Wen Simo, both Xingzi and Kaiwen agree that only Chun Yuqiao can approve the new season's rules. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
